{
  "id": "ashcombe",
  "note": [
    "A retailer profile. Everything category-shaped that the seed pack needs",
    "lives here so that re-targeting the system at a different retailer is a",
    "new file rather than a refactor. The generator reads it; the parts the",
    "running system needs are copied into catalog.json under `profile`, so",
    "sc/ reads them from the baseline instead of hardcoding prefixes.",
    "",
    "Every retailer name, banner and supplier here is invented. Product",
    "descriptors are ordinary retail language on purpose - a shopper would",
    "recognise 'Semi-Skimmed Milk 2L'; nobody recognises 'Whirl 543'."
  ],

  "fascia": {
    "name": "Ashcombe",
    "legal_name": "Ashcombe Retail Group plc",
    "market": "United Kingdom",
    "currency": "GBP",
    "banners": ["Ashcombe", "Ashcombe Extra", "Ashcombe Local"],
    "own_brand_tiers": [
      { "key": "value", "prefix": "Ashcombe Everyday" },
      { "key": "core", "prefix": "Ashcombe" },
      { "key": "premium", "prefix": "Ashcombe Reserve" }
    ]
  },

